    "Exact_proposed_text": "Resolve each executable input locator against its bound source receipt before\nrelease. A label-only metadata successor does not repair a missing or cross-branch\ninput path; freeze a new execution contract with corrected locators and preserve\nthe original packet without backfilling misleading filenames.\n",
